  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，你能想象吗，我把南京的大房子卖了，一家人蜗居在香港的小出租屋里，这样的生活你愿意吗？我儿子两岁半，开始在香港念幼儿园了，我喜欢香港的国际化教育环境，人是环境的产物，孟母三迁既是对孩子的托举，也是对我自己的成长。就像渔夫出海前，并不知道鱼在哪里，可是他还是选择出发，因为他们相信，一定会满载而归。#香港 #维多利亚港 #大湾区 #幼儿教育",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_bbfa54f94f503347_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 232.455011,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱军，你能想象吗？我把南京的大房子卖了，一家人蜗居在香港的小出租屋里，这样的生活你愿意吗？我儿子两岁半开始在香港念幼儿园了，第一天送他去学校的时候特别紧张，我怕他哭，怕他听不懂，甚至怕自己作为一个父亲，是不是替一个两岁孩子做了一个太大的决定，结果没想到他比我勇敢。我儿子很快就适应香港的幼儿园，配了三组，老师是两文三语的教育、普通话、粤语和英语。我从小出生在淮安的农村家门口，就是京杭大运河。后来在我上小学的时候，父母把我带到了南京这座城市，把家搬到了长江边。现在我又牵着我儿子的手把他带到香港维多利亚港的海边。我们一个家庭的三代人，就这样一步一步沿着水走向更大的世界。我特别喜欢香港的国际化教育环境，我也越发理解人就是环境的产物。所谓孟母三迁，这既是对孩子的托举，也是对于我自己的成长。周军，你能想象吗？决定搬来香港，我只花了一天的时间。曾经有一位前辈跟我说过一段话，他说跳槽、结婚、换城市等等。这种人生大事没有一件是靠周密的计划完成了，都是机会来了，脑子一热就上，然后人生就拐了个弯儿。这句话我记了好多年。真正重要的事情是不给你时间准备的。还记得来香港租房子的时候，中介推荐了好多房源。我看到第一户就感觉很有缘分，特别喜欢窗外的海景。我说其他就不看了，就他了。虽然只有六十平米，但是每个月租金高达三万多块钱。寸土寸金，是香港最谦虚的说法。出门买菜买半棵，圆白菜竟然要花四十多块钱。但是香港的食品安全也很规范，在这里你永远不用担心吃到嘴里的东西不安全。超市里的每一颗蔬菜都能精准追溯到原产地。我儿子渐渐的喜欢上了香港下楼散步逛商场，总能看到很多人用推车推着小动物。香港街头很少见到流浪猫流浪狗，突然发现我最幸福的是就是有一个儿子，名利，金钱皆是过眼云烟。唯有这个朝气蓬勃的少年，是我满心的欢喜。儿子身上全是小时候我的影子，贪玩倔强，他不是我却又像极了我，我带他来香港，只是希望他的世界可以比我小时候大一点，特别感恩于这个时代。让我们做新媒体的人，只要有一台手机，我在任何地方都能工作，还能够陪伴家人。孩子说实话，我也不知道香港是不是最好的答案，但我知道，停在原地，一定不是我的答案。我很喜欢香港的城市风水格局。每次来到香港，整个人都好像充满了电。这里会让一些洗金水的人天然产生事业心。明年是香港回归祖国三十周年，我相信三十而立的香港会是他最好的黄金时代。今年国庆假期，维多利亚港会再次举行烟花汇演，我们将要度过第一个全家。在香港的中秋节，我儿子特别喜欢吃香港月饼。今天我在香港的地铁站，看到一句话，一瞬间，我竟然泪流满面，请往前走，不要在此停留。我不确定搬到香港最终会收获什么？但是我相信人只要卯足劲往前走，就一定有新的东西在前面等着，甚至比那些错过的懊恼的还要好一万倍。就像渔夫出海之前并不知道鱼在哪里，可是他还是选择出发，因为他们相信一定会满载而归。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00001",
      "start_ms": 340,
      "end_ms": 780,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1180,
      "end_ms": 2080,
      "text": "你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2440,
      "end_ms": 4180,
      "text": "我把南京的大房子卖了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4300,
      "end_ms": 6880,
      "text": "一家人蜗居在香港的小出租屋里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7220,
      "end_ms": 9080,
      "text": "这样的生活你愿意吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9980,
      "end_ms": 13220,
      "text": "我儿子两岁半开始在香港念幼儿园了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13440,
      "end_ms": 15920,
      "text": "第一天送他去学校的时候特别紧张，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16219,
      "end_ms": 17040,
      "text": "我怕他哭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17460,
      "end_ms": 18240,
      "text": "怕他听不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18780,
      "end_ms": 20460,
      "text": "甚至怕自己作为一个父亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20660,
      "end_ms": 23440,
      "text": "是不是替一个两岁孩子做了一个太大的决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24000,
      "end_ms": 25900,
      "text": "结果没想到他比我勇敢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00013",
      "start_ms": 26260,
      "end_ms": 29100,
      "text": "我儿子很快就适应香港的幼儿园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00014",
      "start_ms": 29100,
      "end_ms": 29640,
      "text": "配了三组，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29640,
      "end_ms": 34090,
      "text": "老师是两文三语的教育、普通话、粤语和英语。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35050,
      "end_ms": 37750,
      "text": "我从小出生在淮安的农村家门口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00017",
      "start_ms": 37750,
      "end_ms": 39050,
      "text": "就是京杭大运河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39510,
      "end_ms": 40990,
      "text": "后来在我上小学的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00019",
      "start_ms": 40990,
      "end_ms": 43110,
      "text": "父母把我带到了南京这座城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00020",
      "start_ms": 43410,
      "end_ms": 45090,
      "text": "把家搬到了长江边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00021",
      "start_ms": 45630,
      "end_ms": 50290,
      "text": "现在我又牵着我儿子的手把他带到香港维多利亚港的海边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00022",
      "start_ms": 50970,
      "end_ms": 52390,
      "text": "我们一个家庭的三代人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00023",
      "start_ms": 52390,
      "end_ms": 56030,
      "text": "就这样一步一步沿着水走向更大的世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00024",
      "start_ms": 56610,
      "end_ms": 59030,
      "text": "我特别喜欢香港的国际化教育环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00025",
      "start_ms": 59330,
      "end_ms": 62655,
      "text": "我也越发理解人就是环境的产物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00026",
      "start_ms": 63180,
      "end_ms": 64435,
      "text": "所谓孟母三迁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00027",
      "start_ms": 64780,
      "end_ms": 66275,
      "text": "这既是对孩子的托举，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00028",
      "start_ms": 66650,
      "end_ms": 68205,
      "text": "也是对于我自己的成长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00029",
      "start_ms": 68870,
      "end_ms": 69190,
      "text": "周军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00030",
      "start_ms": 69190,
      "end_ms": 69950,
      "text": "你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00031",
      "start_ms": 70230,
      "end_ms": 71310,
      "text": "决定搬来香港，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00032",
      "start_ms": 71470,
      "end_ms": 72965,
      "text": "我只花了一天的时间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00033",
      "start_ms": 73740,
      "end_ms": 75560,
      "text": "曾经有一位前辈跟我说过一段话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00034",
      "start_ms": 75700,
      "end_ms": 78300,
      "text": "他说跳槽、结婚、换城市等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00035",
      "start_ms": 78300,
      "end_ms": 82285,
      "text": "这种人生大事没有一件是靠周密的计划完成了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00036",
      "start_ms": 82530,
      "end_ms": 83970,
      "text": "都是机会来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00037",
      "start_ms": 84110,
      "end_ms": 85070,
      "text": "脑子一热就上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00038",
      "start_ms": 85370,
      "end_ms": 87585,
      "text": "然后人生就拐了个弯儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00039",
      "start_ms": 88070,
      "end_ms": 89455,
      "text": "这句话我记了好多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00040",
      "start_ms": 89850,
      "end_ms": 92585,
      "text": "真正重要的事情是不给你时间准备的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00041",
      "start_ms": 93540,
      "end_ms": 95220,
      "text": "还记得来香港租房子的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00042",
      "start_ms": 95220,
      "end_ms": 96855,
      "text": "中介推荐了好多房源。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00043",
      "start_ms": 97200,
      "end_ms": 99575,
      "text": "我看到第一户就感觉很有缘分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00044",
      "start_ms": 99920,
      "end_ms": 101340,
      "text": "特别喜欢窗外的海景。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00045",
      "start_ms": 101480,
      "end_ms": 103100,
      "text": "我说其他就不看了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00046",
      "start_ms": 103280,
      "end_ms": 103965,
      "text": "就他了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00047",
      "start_ms": 104680,
      "end_ms": 106060,
      "text": "虽然只有六十平米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00048",
      "start_ms": 106060,
      "end_ms": 108425,
      "text": "但是每个月租金高达三万多块钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00049",
      "start_ms": 109170,
      "end_ms": 110130,
      "text": "寸土寸金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00050",
      "start_ms": 110270,
      "end_ms": 111945,
      "text": "是香港最谦虚的说法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00051",
      "start_ms": 112490,
      "end_ms": 114390,
      "text": "出门买菜买半棵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00052",
      "start_ms": 114410,
      "end_ms": 116675,
      "text": "圆白菜竟然要花四十多块钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00053",
      "start_ms": 117240,
      "end_ms": 119475,
      "text": "但是香港的食品安全也很规范，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00054",
      "start_ms": 119860,
      "end_ms": 122965,
      "text": "在这里你永远不用担心吃到嘴里的东西不安全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00055",
      "start_ms": 123350,
      "end_ms": 126505,
      "text": "超市里的每一颗蔬菜都能精准追溯到原产地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00056",
      "start_ms": 127110,
      "end_ms": 130760,
      "text": "我儿子渐渐的喜欢上了香港下楼散步逛商场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00057",
      "start_ms": 130900,
      "end_ms": 133605,
      "text": "总能看到很多人用推车推着小动物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00058",
      "start_ms": 133980,
      "end_ms": 136715,
      "text": "香港街头很少见到流浪猫流浪狗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00059",
      "start_ms": 137150,
      "end_ms": 140425,
      "text": "突然发现我最幸福的是就是有一个儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00060",
      "start_ms": 140970,
      "end_ms": 141450,
      "text": "名利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00061",
      "start_ms": 141530,
      "end_ms": 143455,
      "text": "金钱皆是过眼云烟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00062",
      "start_ms": 143810,
      "end_ms": 145815,
      "text": "唯有这个朝气蓬勃的少年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00063",
      "start_ms": 146190,
      "end_ms": 147365,
      "text": "是我满心的欢喜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00064",
      "start_ms": 148140,
      "end_ms": 150345,
      "text": "儿子身上全是小时候我的影子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00065",
      "start_ms": 150660,
      "end_ms": 151975,
      "text": "贪玩倔强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00066",
      "start_ms": 152460,
      "end_ms": 154695,
      "text": "他不是我却又像极了我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00067",
      "start_ms": 155220,
      "end_ms": 156200,
      "text": "我带他来香港，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00068",
      "start_ms": 156200,
      "end_ms": 160115,
      "text": "只是希望他的世界可以比我小时候大一点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00069",
      "start_ms": 161210,
      "end_ms": 162530,
      "text": "特别感恩于这个时代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00070",
      "start_ms": 162710,
      "end_ms": 163965,
      "text": "让我们做新媒体的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00071",
      "start_ms": 164220,
      "end_ms": 165305,
      "text": "只要有一台手机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00072",
      "start_ms": 165550,
      "end_ms": 167010,
      "text": "我在任何地方都能工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00073",
      "start_ms": 167190,
      "end_ms": 168370,
      "text": "还能够陪伴家人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00074",
      "start_ms": 168370,
      "end_ms": 169700,
      "text": "孩子说实话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00075",
      "start_ms": 169700,
      "end_ms": 171855,
      "text": "我也不知道香港是不是最好的答案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00076",
      "start_ms": 172120,
      "end_ms": 172760,
      "text": "但我知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00077",
      "start_ms": 172840,
      "end_ms": 173760,
      "text": "停在原地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00078",
      "start_ms": 173840,
      "end_ms": 175035,
      "text": "一定不是我的答案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00079",
      "start_ms": 175420,
      "end_ms": 177705,
      "text": "我很喜欢香港的城市风水格局。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00080",
      "start_ms": 178110,
      "end_ms": 178970,
      "text": "每次来到香港，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00081",
      "start_ms": 178970,
      "end_ms": 180405,
      "text": "整个人都好像充满了电。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00082",
      "start_ms": 180750,
      "end_ms": 184055,
      "text": "这里会让一些洗金水的人天然产生事业心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00083",
      "start_ms": 184720,
      "end_ms": 186765,
      "text": "明年是香港回归祖国三十周年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00084",
      "start_ms": 187100,
      "end_ms": 190885,
      "text": "我相信三十而立的香港会是他最好的黄金时代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00085",
      "start_ms": 191370,
      "end_ms": 192375,
      "text": "今年国庆假期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00086",
      "start_ms": 192690,
      "end_ms": 195095,
      "text": "维多利亚港会再次举行烟花汇演，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00087",
      "start_ms": 195530,
      "end_ms": 197150,
      "text": "我们将要度过第一个全家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00088",
      "start_ms": 197150,
      "end_ms": 198505,
      "text": "在香港的中秋节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00089",
      "start_ms": 198930,
      "end_ms": 201025,
      "text": "我儿子特别喜欢吃香港月饼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00090",
      "start_ms": 201920,
      "end_ms": 203240,
      "text": "今天我在香港的地铁站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00091",
      "start_ms": 203260,
      "end_ms": 203940,
      "text": "看到一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00092",
      "start_ms": 204120,
      "end_ms": 204780,
      "text": "一瞬间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00093",
      "start_ms": 204920,
      "end_ms": 206075,
      "text": "我竟然泪流满面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00094",
      "start_ms": 206950,
      "end_ms": 208095,
      "text": "请往前走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00095",
      "start_ms": 208480,
      "end_ms": 209835,
      "text": "不要在此停留。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00096",
      "start_ms": 210730,
      "end_ms": 213295,
      "text": "我不确定搬到香港最终会收获什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00097",
      "start_ms": 213570,
      "end_ms": 216765,
      "text": "但是我相信人只要卯足劲往前走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00098",
      "start_ms": 216980,
      "end_ms": 219305,
      "text": "就一定有新的东西在前面等着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00099",
      "start_ms": 219860,
      "end_ms": 222995,
      "text": "甚至比那些错过的懊恼的还要好一万倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00100",
      "start_ms": 223510,
      "end_ms": 226885,
      "text": "就像渔夫出海之前并不知道鱼在哪里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00101",
      "start_ms": 227250,
      "end_ms": 228905,
      "text": "可是他还是选择出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbfa54f94f503347_s00102",
      "start_ms": 229310,
      "end_ms": 232245,
      "text": "因为他们相信一定会满载而归。"
    }
  ],
